<<~ ahu slot=`#/built`>>

!! Built
* ''Port.'' `port:open{boot}` and `port:boot` (mesh `record-port.ts`, browser `holder-routes.ts`); the island serves its boot set ahead of the snapshot (`record-port-handler.ts` `postBoot`, `island-context.ts` `bootSet`, set in `sovereign-kernel.ts` for node and browser alike).
* ''Page boot.'' `glass-handoff.ts` (reader, three named refusals), `glass/stand.ts` rewritten (handoff, then engine, then story, then paint; full first; the one step in both seats), `glass-mirror.ts` `censusRecords` + `bootSetTitles`, `glass-port-adaptor.ts` `opened`, `glassPortOpen`, `glassLocalTitle`.
* ''Doors.'' `glass-root.ts` (modal, notify, pane scroller, focus, rename, relink, clipboard, download, open-surface, full screen, http refusal), `glass-camera.ts` (engine's own root, stock-shaped pane, refresh hooks, pane-scoped shortcuts), `glass/doors.ts`, `page-doors.ts`, `page-mirror.ts`, `main.ts` (reload re-stands the mirror).
* ''Ripped out.'' `glass/cas.ts`, `glass/cid.ts`, the page export of `readCasBlobFromOpfs`, skinny-then-promote in `stand.ts`, `adaptor.widen`, the `promoted` event, the promotion wait, `glass-promote.page.test.ts` (became `glass-full-first`), `e2e/glass-edit-under-promotion`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/page-paths-touched`>>

!! Page paths touched
* `#mirror` shadow root: `.lar-mirror.tc-body` now holds `.tc-page-container-wrapper` as first child; modals (`.tc-modal-wrapper`) and notifications (`.tc-notification`) append beside it.
* `data-lar-mirror-why` reads `full-boot-unfinished` where it read `full-promotion-unfinished`.
* `#mirror.larMirrorReading.handed = { members, records }`: new read-only field.
* The mirror reads `full` at first paint; no skinny first paint on a clean tab.
* No change to `index.html`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/tests-proved-alone`>>

!! Tests proved alone (chromium for page tests; firefox and WebKit not run here)
* tw5 (node): record-port-boot (new), glass-census-records (new), glass-port-adaptor-races (adopted-open test replaces the widen test), glass-port-adaptor, glass-door-census (extended: new sources, no page store), glass-census, glass-census-promoted, record-port-handler, record-port-widen, record-port-lease, mirror-browser-mode-control, island-story-owes-no-save.
* mesh: record-port. tools: browser-weld-mirror (12/12, M6 new).
* web page: glass-full-first (new, 17), glass-doors (new, 11), glass-stepdown (rewritten), glass-mirror, glass-page-mirror, glass-boot, mirror-plugin-gate, mirror-savers, mirror-browser-mode, glass-theme, glass-topology, glass-walk, projection-sink-services: 13 files, 93 tests green after the merge.
* Gates: `pnpm -r typecheck` clean; tw5 test typecheck at its ceiling (219). Web test typecheck read 73 in this worktree against a ceiling of 71; I did not establish a base reading here, and the worktree lacks node's probe dist, so that count stays unverified.
* NOT run: any e2e, the weld, tree-clean, firefox, `witness-all`, the full suites.

