<<~ ahu slot=`#/forks-decided`>>

!! Forks decided (canon `d3-glass-lane` #/moolelo, each overrulable)
Full first (overturns the 2026-10-28 promote order on G7's pass) · the kernel rides inside the engine blob, not split from `$:/core` · the vessel's CIDs kept as a second speaker · held records land after boot · a wiki's StartupAction records never run on the surface · the address bar untouched, links go to the clipboard · no draft throttle timer.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/owed`>>

!! Owed
* Interaction goldens 01-13 at full against stock TW5: untouched.
* The e2e files `glass-mirror`, `glass-tabs`, `mirror-boot-makes-no-request`, `rest-before-reload` were edited only in comments or not at all and never run; they may still wait on a skinny word or a `full-promotion-unfinished` reason.
* The weld's M1 `settleOf` and M5 were not changed; M6 proves only in CI.
* Skinny's projection carries no system or plugin bodies: a held or stepped mirror paints unstyled with every plugin held.
* `sealedRest` reaches no mirror; code plugins stay held everywhere.
* `http-request` door (D15), `open-surface`, route-in from a link, `$:/tags/StartupAction/PostRender`.
* The node page door: the island serves `port:boot` on Node, and no node-served page asks it.
* Switching the mirror to another wiki; the daemon surface stays at width none.
* `port:boot` carries no ack and rides outside the lag budget; a plugin record above 1 MiB still fails the wire reader.
* The follower tab path with `port:boot` over the BroadcastChannel: `glass-topology` passes with the seam, the real handoff over the bus stays unproven.
* Stock's language switcher still writes `lang`/`dir` on the page's `documentElement`.
* The island's `port:widen` row stays in the contract, though no mirror sends one (`tab-bus.ts` no longer rewrites a remembered open on it).

<<~/ahu>>

